WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.450
Balanced forces cancel out, but they are still there.

2
00:00:04.229 --> 00:00:08.679
The moving box has four newtons of push forward and four of friction back.

3
00:00:12.305 --> 00:00:16.030
The forces are balanced, so the dots stay evenly spaced.

4
00:00:16.755 --> 00:00:21.105
Balanced doesn't mean no forces: it means the motion doesn't change.
